WEBVTT

00:12:31.162 --> 00:12:32.866
Just like I did."

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:37.151
But you won't be able to say that,

00:12:37.175 --> 00:12:38.833
because you didn't.

00:12:38.857 --> 00:12:40.432
So you can't.

00:12:40.456 --> 00:12:42.421
(Laughter)

00:12:45.086 --> 00:12:48.253
And so the sins of the parents

00:12:48.277 --> 00:12:50.404
are visited on the poor children.

00:12:52.277 --> 00:12:57.800
Why will you seek refuge
in human relationships

00:12:57.824 --> 00:13:03.753
as your excuse not to find
and pursue your passion?